<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Triage AI — Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0F1113;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #0A3D3F;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #14C3C9;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #14C3C9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #2F2F2F;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .card h2 {
            color: #14C3C9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .card p {
            color: #D9D9D9;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            background-color: #14C3C9;
            color: #0F1113;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #0FB2B7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
    <div style="color:white; font-weight:bold;">Triage AI</div>
    <div>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        <a href="dashboard.html">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="support.html">Support</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Dashboard</h1>
    <p>Welcome to your Triage AI dashboard. Choose a tool below to get started.</p>

    <div class="grid">

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Task Triage</h2>
            <p>Sort, prioritize, and break down tasks into actionable steps.</p>
            <a class="button" href="#">Open Tool</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>AI Insights</h2>
            <p>Generate fast, intelligent summaries and recommendations.</p>
            <a class="button" href="#">Open Tool</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Workflow Builder</h2>
            <p>Create automated flows to streamline repetitive processes.</p>
            <a class="button" href="#">Open Tool</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>System Status</h2>
            <p>Check uptime, performance, and service health.</p>
            <a class="button" href="#">View Status</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
